  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、オーディション番組の\r\nオファーが来てるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『G.R.A.D.』って番組、聞いたことないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003010050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……！\r\nし、知っとる……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400301/1004003010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘はユニットとしても活躍してくれてるし、\r\nもちろんソロでの仕事も頑張ってくれてる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "他の仕事もある中でこの番組の\r\nオファーを受けるかどうか、正直迷った",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003010060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……ふぇ……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400301/1004003010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘の負担になるようだったら、\r\n今回は見送ってもいいかとも思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だけどきっと、恋鐘がアイドルとして\r\nより一層成長できるきっかけにもなると思うんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003010070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "…………！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400301/1004003010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だからさ、まずは恋鐘の意見を聞きたい\r\nどうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003010080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そ、そがんと……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400301/1004003010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003010090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "もっちろん出るばい！\r\nうちが出らんば始まらんもんね！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400301/1004003010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それなら、うん\r\n一緒に頑張ろう！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003010100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～、ば～りばりに頑張って\r\n絶対に優勝するばい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400301/1004003010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……頼もしいな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
